  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile investigation): Worst-offender of the Axis-B (envelope-incomplete) sub-cluster within WI-gogif; sibling of INV-fipol and INV-pazum. Source code at the emission site has an explicit comment (\"Preserve the legacy flat-list schema for programmatic consumers\") flagging this as intentional backward-compat. Cluster-wide fix needs to address the migration path: either an opt-in --envelope flag, a deprecation cycle, or coordination with a schema_version major bump so the wrapped envelope arrives as a breaking change tied to a version transition."  # c45a
